<title>ITALY: Italy's San Paolo max price 10,850 lire.</title>
<headline>Italy's San Paolo max price 10,850 lire.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bank San Paolo said the maximum price in its public share offer would be 10,850 lire per share, while the discount to the public would be 2.5 percent.</p>
<p>The public share offer begins on Monday May 19 and finishes on Friday May 23.</p>
</text>
